{"bankId":"B-SRC-31-2107","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0007","constructFamily":"double_fence_with_gate","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah kebun berbentuk segi empat tepat berukuran 28 m × 16 m hendak dipasang dua lapis dawai. Sebuah pintu selebar 4 m tidak dipasang dawai pada kedua-dua lapis. Berapakah jumlah panjang dawai diperlukan?","options":["168 m","176 m","164 m","84 m"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Perimeter kebun = 2(28 + 16) = 88 m.","Dua lapis memerlukan 2 × 88 = 176 m.","Bahagian pintu tidak berdawai pada dua lapis = 2 × 4 = 8 m, jadi 176 − 8 = 168 m."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-31-2108","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0008","constructFamily":"rectangle_area_after_border_strip","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah papan segi empat tepat berukuran 20 cm × 14 cm. Jalur selebar 2 cm dipotong sepanjang satu sisi 20 cm. Berapakah luas papan yang tinggal?","options":["260 cm²","240 cm²","236 cm²","224 cm²"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Luas asal = 20 × 14 = 280 cm².","Luas jalur yang dipotong = 20 × 2 = 40 cm².","Luas tinggal = 280 − 40 = 240 cm²."],"visual":{"kind":"rectangle","length_cm":20,"width_cm":14}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-31-2109","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0009","constructFamily":"cuboid_water_after_fraction_removed","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah bekas kuboid berukuran 15 cm × 10 cm × 8 cm diisi penuh dengan air. Sebanyak 1/4 daripada air itu dikeluarkan. Berapakah isi padu air yang masih tinggal?","options":["300 cm³","1 000 cm³","900 cm³","1 200 cm³"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Isi padu penuh = 15 × 10 × 8 = 1200 cm³.","Air yang tinggal = 3/4 × 1200 = 900 cm³."],"visual":{"kind":"cuboid","length_cm":15,"width_cm":10,"height_cm":8}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-31-2110","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0010","constructFamily":"elapsed_time_with_two_breaks","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Sebuah bengkel bermula pada 8:45 pagi. Sesi pertama 1 jam 20 minit, rehat 15 minit, sesi kedua 55 minit dan rehat akhir 10 minit. Pada pukul berapakah bengkel tamat?","options":["11:15 pagi","11:35 pagi","11:10 pagi","11:25 pagi"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["8:45 + 1 jam 20 minit = 10:05 pagi.","Tambah 15 minit = 10:20 pagi; tambah 55 minit = 11:15 pagi.","Tambah 10 minit = 11:25 pagi."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-31-2111","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0011","constructFamily":"unit_price_bundle_change","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Empat botol minuman berharga RM3.60 setiap satu dan tiga sandwic berharga RM5.20 setiap satu. Jika dibayar dengan RM50, berapakah baki wang?","options":["RM20.00","RM19.40","RM21.00","RM18.60"],"answerIndex":0,"solutionSteps":["Kos minuman = 4 × RM3.60 = RM14.40.","Kos sandwic = 3 × RM5.20 = RM15.60; jumlah = RM30.00.","Baki = RM50.00 − RM30.00 = RM20.00."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-31-2112","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0012","constructFamily":"mean_after_data_correction","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Rajah data menunjukkan 12, 15, 18, 20 dan 25. Nilai 25 sebenarnya tersalah catat dan sepatutnya 30. Berapakah min baharu?","options":["18","19","20","21"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah asal = 12 + 15 + 18 + 20 + 25 = 90.","Gantikan 25 dengan 30: jumlah baharu = 95.","Min baharu = 95 ÷ 5 = 19."],"visual":{"kind":"five_value_data","values":[12,15,18,20,25]}}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-31-2113","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0001","constructFamily":"angles_around_point_ratio_three","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Tiga sudut di sekeliling satu titik mempunyai nisbah 2:3:5. Berapakah sudut yang paling kecil?","options":["54°","90°","72°","108°"],"answerIndex":2,"solutionSteps":["Jumlah bahagian = 2 + 3 + 5 = 10.","Satu bahagian = 360° ÷ 10 = 36°.","Sudut paling kecil = 2 × 36° = 72°."]}
{"bankId":"B-SRC-31-2114","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0013","constructFamily":"coordinate_route_scaled_distance","plannedLevel":3,"question":"Pada grid, sebuah robot bermula di (2,4) dan bergerak 6 unit ke kanan. Jika setiap 1 unit mewakili 250 m, berapakah jarak sebenar yang dilalui?","options":["1.25 km","1.75 km","2 km","1.5 km"],"answerIndex":3,"solutionSteps":["Jarak pada grid = 6 unit.","Jarak sebenar = 6 × 250 m = 1500 m.","1500 m = 1.5 km."],"visual":{"kind":"coordinate_move","start":[2,4],"move_right":6}}
